       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我想先听听不同人的看法。",
       "alumno": "First I want to hear different people's views.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果大家的意见不一样呢？",
       "alumno": "What if people's opinions are different?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以把理由写下来，再一起讨论。",
       "alumno": "We can write down the reasons and discuss them together.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: evaluating arguments",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "讨论「说明原因与结果」时，要区分事实、推论和个人立场。",
       "alumno": "When discussing «explaining causes and results», you must distinguish facts, inferences and personal positions.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "说明证据的来源并回应反例，结论才更有说服力。",
       "alumno": "Explaining where the evidence comes from and responding to counterexamples strengthens the conclusion.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较几种办法时，可以先说明各自的优点和不足。",
       "alumno": "When comparing several options, you can first explain their advantages and disadvantages.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
